h your brother and grant you both supremacy so they will not reach you. [It will be] through Our signs; you and those who follow you will be the predominant.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":35,"sd":null}],"juz":20,"hizb":39,"surahs":[28],"sajdah":false}